			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">7.17.2025::11:56:47</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 Performance measurements\par%0D
Measurement Environment : \par%0D
HW : \ulwave Traveo\ulnone  \ulwave II\ulnone  C, Clock : GPT 60 MHZ\par%0D
 \par%0D
\ulwave Contect\ulnone  Switch:\par%0D
Context switch time for start task : 5 us\par%0D
Context switch time for resume task : 7 us\par%0D
Context switch time for CAT2 ISR trigger : 8 us\par%0D
 \par%0D
\ulwave Cpu\ulnone  Load:\par%0D
vAutosar CPU load : 12.16 %25\par%0D
vAutosar CPU load with MPU switch : 29.4 %25\par%0D
vAutosar CPU load with User and Supervisor mode : 13.4 %25\par%0D
 \par%0D
Time taken for one MPU Switch : 2.25us\par%0D
Time taken for one supervisor mode enable : 1us\par%0D
 \par%0D
EcuM \ulwave Init\ulnone  to Start of First task in mOS : 4.2 ms\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
			</IDescription>
