				<_modifiedTime type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTime>
				<_body type="a">r10 must be pushed first%0D
push 0-r12 and lr to stack%0D
push the current context into stack%0D
push the current ObjRef to stack%0D
increment the LockDispatcher%0D
save current sp to r4</_body>
			</IAction>
			</_entryAction>
		</IState>
